; Idle counter: passes since the last key or tune pass
;
; Incremented once per pass by #R$89AD ($8ABB). When it wraps to 0 (after 256
; passes) the frame loop does not go on but waits for a key, as if paused
; (#R$89AD, $8AD1). It is cleared in every pass in which the tune plays (#R$8B07,
; $8B3D) and whenever Willy's movement code sees a left or right key or a jump
; (#R$8DD3, $8F4E, $8F5B, $8F9A). The effect: with the tune off and no key
; for 256 passes the game stops by itself. Cleared by #R$87CA.
; .
; Observed: with the tune off and no key pressed the loop stopped at the wait
; after exactly 256 passes; with the tune on it never did.
@label=IdleCounter
g$85E0 DEFB $00
